      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/4491bb/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-08-02T20:22:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you can get Haka's deck in your hand with 2 Dominions in play, you can perma-play ground pound.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I tipically go for achievements with Haka Visionary and Tempest, where I keep the vilain at full health until I'm ready for whatever condition I need. &nbsp;Haka eats everything and ground pounds. &nbsp;Visionary helps Haka get the cards and suggests the villain what to do and Tempest heals while keeping important cards in hand with reclaim from the deep until all cards are in hand.</p>",
