      "created_at": "2016-08-03T11:21:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Nepycros\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/8491ac/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Nepycros:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I was only able to scrounge up 71 non-character targets.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>71 is the correct number: 22 villain targets, 12 environment targets, 23 constructs and 14 bots.</p>\n<p>I think theoretical max damage is 182?</p>\n<p>142 savage mana + 1 Galvanize +1 Inspiring Presence + 38 Haka of battle (only have Savage Mana in play, although painfully more slow to get to this point without Taiaha)</p>\n<p>Edit: 184! (let Haka skip his power, then +2 Hasty Augmentation from Unity)</p>",
