      "cooked": "<p>Mint, but 1 shy of catching them all. Damn you Unforgiving Wasteland!!! Finished with a 193 Haka of Battle enfused burst of Savage Mana goodness. I would have built it up further, but it was late and the wife was glaring.</p><p>On a side note, waiting for the 70 cards under Savage Mana&nbsp;to load so I could choose which one I wanted to destroy first was about 8 minutes of pure joy I'll never get back. I heard the update will&nbsp;have some optimizations. I'll have to give it another shot to see.</p>",
