      "created_at": "2016-08-08T20:20:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just re-tried this one-shot with the latest update on my phone and I gotta say, HUGE improvement in performance. I actually willing threw Augmented Ally on Haka to get the extra power use. Before the update I destroyed that bad boy the first chance I got because it took forever to open up his hand to select a card to discard&nbsp;once he had all of his cards.</p><p>This time around I got all 71 targets, and finished him off with Savage Mana only taking a few seconds to bring up the 71 cards underneath it to choose which to destroy first. Great job on the performance enhancements.</p>",
